		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=4798&amp;p=35387#p35387"><![CDATA[
I would start by testing the battery's condition by applying a load to measure its performance under use.<br>You could also try connecting a power supply directly to the radio terminals.<br><br>Once you've ruled out the battery as the issue, I would open the radio and inspect the solder joints. I've seen photos showing very poor soldering quality.<br><br>73<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=7866">LU7CGJ</a> — Sun Jan 26, 2025 8:18 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
